==Battleground==
*1 [[Golden Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

Note that this stage has an average Banknote drop of 11.7, meaning you have a 17% profit on average. This is better than the second stage, but still worse than the last stage.

